# Separator - a hairline between groups.  Separator()  ·  Separator(orientation: "vertical")
# shadcn-for-muten · part · no deps · Nova (.cn-separator).
part Separator(orientation: text = "horizontal") { Stack class("cn-separator cn-separator-{$orientation}") data(slot: "separator", orientation: $orientation) aria(role: "separator", orientation: $orientation) }
